<p>So yeah, just here to say this is my first SCP, inspired by the book I've been reading about Czech surrealism. Objektiv isn't meant to be a GOI or anything; this was their first and only attempt at an anomalous object, and once it went wrong the group kind of sputtered out. Aside from their involvement in this SCP, I imagine they were an ordinary group of Czech surrealist writers/artists.</p>
